      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 479991140,
          "type": null,
          "body": "hi Peter! Happy new year too! <3\n\nI obviously google a lot to describe all those protocols and functionalities ) This specific one is the rewording from the [Wireshark wiki](https://wiki.wireshark.org/UCP) and common [wiki](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/EMI_(protocol)) - I didn't add EMI protocol (they are going side by side) to not confuse the user. Could you suggest someone, who can be an expert in this case to review the section? Could @JaapKeuter maybe review it? as this commit was made by him/her..",
